      "widgets_values": [
        "Fills the target region by propagating colors inward from the target boundary using a random-weighted onion-peel rule (simple content fill for inpainting prep).\n\nInputs (required): image:IMAGE, mask:MASK, mask_mode:ENUM, propagate_iterations:INT, use_angular_drift:BOOLEAN, drift_radius:INT, use_center_blend:BOOLEAN, center_blend_strength:FLOAT, blur_center:BOOLEAN, blur_strength:FLOAT, blur_falloff_distance:INT, feather_amount:INT\nOutputs: infilled_image:IMAGE, distance_map_viz:IMAGE, blur_weight_viz:IMAGE\n\nImage-group node fed by an EmptyImage provider. Output is previewed with PreviewImage (or MaskToImage -> PreviewImage for MASK outputs)."
